<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's dairy raises profits.</title>
<headline>Morocco's dairy raises profits.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's leading dairy firm Centrale Laitiere, showed 89.5 million dirhams ($9.6 million) net profits in 1996 against 26 million dirhams losses in 1995.</p>
<p>An offshoot of Morocco's largest private conglomerate ONA group, Centrale Laitiere posted a turnover of 2.07 billion dirhams in 1996 against 2.2 billion dirhams in 1995, L'Economiste weekly newspaper reported on Friday.</p>
<p>Last year, ceded 20 percent of its majority stake in Centrale Laitiere to French Groupe Danone.</p>
<p>Listed on the Casablanca bourse, Centrale Laitiere was traded at 2,719 dirhams per share.</p>
</text>
